    {"from": 1308, "to": 1322, "part": "towers", "what": "Under Archbishop Pierre de Savoie the north tower (Saint-Thomas) is prioritised; the south tower is finished about a century later, with no bell", "source": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cathédrale_Saint-Jean-Baptiste_de_Lyon", "certainty": "approximate"},
